{"id":"vod_sn_37091","vodId":"37091","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"血意少年","name_cn":"血意少年","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第10集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/467c2480ef46f210cf1c9c3986424d93.jpg"},"summary":"名震东魔界的吸血鬼少年史塔兹（逢坂良太 配音）带着不小心闯入魔界而丢掉性命的日本萌高中生柳冬实（野水伊织 配音）进入殿堂魔界，寻找他的哥哥。与此同时，吸血鬼猎人集团“无所畏惧小队（Team Fearless）”正策划向史塔兹发动袭击。然而动员了半天，队员们却没有一个积极响应，无奈之下，队长只得一个人尾随史塔兹。他将自己变成了猫，时刻观察史塔兹和冬实的行踪。未过多久，队长带着无所畏惧小队向史塔兹发动进攻，史塔兹身受重伤，冬实更被对方掳走。狂傲的史塔兹面临最大的危机……　　本片根据小玉有起的原作漫画改编，为同名动画的OAD版。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xXubVw57Nq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9pNrx8thvE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ELZsnFJqrA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XTZkYyhcaQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DbiBakB3781/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jN3amFjcgT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g8BfzhdgBy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9mcPCY7ZQ61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JMA3fCzV0n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xtupKAAeBA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RzNvy1MzHV1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:15.253Z"}